    "reliability": "PARTIAL. The global optimum is narrow/hard to reach (only ~1/80 random restarts find it; median random restart 0.35), but a band of near-optima within floor+0.04 (114 distinct local optima) disagree on 12 of 45 scored tasks. 33/45 scored tasks are STABLE (>=0.90 label agreement across all 114 near-optima) = trustworthy. 12/45 are SWING (4 near coin-flips). Combined with the model being only approximate (RMSE 0.069), per-task labels for the swing set are NOT reliable.",
